721
00:49:15.065 --> 00:49:17.399
Apakah kita putus? Katakan lagi.

722
00:49:17.423 --> 00:49:20.835
Baiklah, Chae Won! Putriku!

723
00:49:20.859 --> 00:49:23.956
KAMP FAKULTAS ILMU KOMUNIKASI

724
00:49:24.416 --> 00:49:27.752
