812
00:55:48.991 --> 00:55:50.929
Putriku...

813
00:55:51.309 --> 00:55:53.163
Benar. Putri yang mana?

814
00:55:53.187 --> 00:55:55.604
Berhenti merengek, berhenti merengek!

815
00:55:55.824 --> 00:55:57.878
Jika kamu menelponnya lagi...

816
00:55:57.902 --> 00:55:59.481
Chae Won...

817
00:56:06.094 --> 00:56:07.193
Apa?

818
00:56:34.905 --> 00:56:36.004
Apa?

819
00:56:37.423 --> 00:56:38.522
Apa?

820
00:57:02.997 --> 00:57:04.496
